(gen_random_uuid(), 'microsoft-ai-diagnostic-orchestrator-mai-dxo-20261119', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator Beats Doctors in Tests',
'Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator ले परीक्षणमा डाक्टरलाई हरायो',
'Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator scored 83.2 percent on hard cases in a peer-reviewed Science study, against 36.1 percent for generalist physicians.',
'Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator ले Science अध्ययनमा कठिन मामिलामा ८३.२ प्रतिशत ल्यायो, सामान्य चिकित्सकको ३६.१ प्रतिशत विरुद्ध।',
$$<p>Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator scored 83.2 percent on hard diagnosis cases in a peer-reviewed study, against 36.1 percent for generalist physicians using reference materials. The paper, published in Science on 22 October 2026, turns a much-discussed 2025 demonstration into validated research. The system is still not a product, and nobody has used it on a live patient yet.</p><h2>Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Information</th></tr><tr><td>Published</td><td>Science, 22 October 2026</td></tr><tr><td>System</td><td>MAI-DxO, running on OpenAI GPT-5</td></tr><tr><td>Hard cases</td><td>83.2% on 304 New England Journal of Medicine cases</td></tr><tr><td>Physicians</td><td>36.1% with references, 22.3% without</td></tr><tr><td>Emergency cases</td><td>80.3% on 325 cases, against 46.8% for physicians</td></tr><tr><td>Benchmark</td><td>SDBench, open-sourced under an MIT licence</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Research only, no product or release date</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>MAI-DxO is not a model. It is an orchestration layer that makes a frontier model work like a panel of doctors, asking questions one at a time and ordering tests in stages rather than answering from a full case file. Microsoft first showed it in June 2025 alongside a preprint, when it scored 85.5 percent against 20 percent for 21 physicians working without references. The peer-reviewed version adds the arm that was missing: doctors who could search and consult references scored 36.1 percent, narrowing the lead from about fourfold to about 2.3 times.</p><p><a href="https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-microsoft-ai-diagnostic-tool-doctors-clinical-tests/">TechRepublic</a> reports the study also tested 325 emergency department cases from the MIMIC-IV-ED database, where the system scored 80.3 percent against 46.8 percent for physicians. <a href="https://tensorfeed.ai/originals/microsoft-mai-dxo-science-doctors-references-gap">TensorFeed</a> notes the system asked an average of 25.5 questions before ordering its first test, against 5.6 for physicians, and that Microsoft has announced a prospective study with Beth Israel Deaconess Medical Center in Boston.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>Diagnosis is one of the highest-stakes uses of AI, and a peer-reviewed result carries weight that a company blog post does not. The study shows orchestration adds real value: plain GPT-5 with a basic prompt scored 78.9 percent on the same cases, so the orchestrator added about four points and cut roughly 3,000 dollars per case in estimated testing costs. It also matters as a contrast to the week's other health AI news, from the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/apple-health-ai-usage-study-200000-openevidence-20261117">Apple health AI study for up to 200,000 people</a> to <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/openai-chatgpt-healthcare-computer-use-agents-20261118">ChatGPT healthcare agents</a>, because this one is a benchmark result, not a product launch.</p><h2>What is not confirmed</h2><p>The cases were historical and text-only, with no physical exam, imaging or pathology slides, and every case had a confirmed diagnosis, so the study could not measure false-positive rates. The human comparison was individual generalists, not specialists or teams, and the authors say they would expect the gap to narrow against specialists. The cost figures are simulated diagnostic spending, not hospital savings. Microsoft has not said when the Beth Israel study will start or when, if ever, the system will reach clinical use.</p><h2>Sources</h2><p><a href="https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-microsoft-ai-diagnostic-tool-doctors-clinical-tests/">TechRepublic</a>; <a href="https://tensorfeed.ai/originals/microsoft-mai-dxo-science-doctors-references-gap">TensorFeed</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator ले सहकर्मी-समीक्षा गरिएको अध्ययनमा कठिन निदान मामिलामा ८३.२ प्रतिशत अङ्क ल्यायो, भने सन्दर्भ सामग्री प्रयोग गर्ने सामान्य चिकित्सकहरूले ३६.१ प्रतिशत ल्याए। २२ अक्टोबर २०२६ मा Science मा प्रकाशित पेपरले धेरै चर्चा गरिएको २०२५ को प्रदर्शनलाई प्रमाणित अनुसन्धानमा बदल्छ। प्रणाली अझै उत्पादन होइन, र कसैले यसलाई जीवित बिरामीमा प्रयोग गरेको छैन।</p><h2>Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>जानकारी</th></tr><tr><td>प्रकाशित</td><td>Science, २२ अक्टोबर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>प्रणाली</td><td>MAI-DxO, OpenAI GPT-5 मा चल्ने</td></tr><tr><td>कठिन मामिला</td><td>३०४ New England Journal of Medicine मामिलामा ८३.२%</td></tr><tr><td>चिकित्सक</td><td>सन्दर्भसहित ३६.१%, सन्दर्भबिना २२.३%</td></tr><tr><td>आकस्मिक मामिला</td><td>३२५ मामिलामा ८०.३%, चिकित्सकको ४६.८% विरुद्ध</td></tr><tr><td>बेन्चमार्क</td><td>SDBench, MIT अनुमतिमा ओपन-सोर्स</td></tr><tr><td>स्थिति</td><td>अनुसन्धान मात्र, उत्पादन वा सार्वजनिक मिति छैन</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>MAI-DxO मोडेल होइन। यो अर्केस्ट्रेसन तह हो जसले फ्रन्टियर मोडेललाई डाक्टरहरूको समूहजस्तै काम गर्न लगाउँछ, एक पटकमा एउटा प्रश्न सोध्छ र पूर्ण केस फाइलबाट जवाफ दिनुको सट्टा चरणबद्ध रूपमा परीक्षण आदेश गर्छ। Microsoft ले यसलाई पहिलो पटक जुन २०२५ मा प्रिप्रिन्टसँगै देखायो, जब यसले सन्दर्भबिना काम गर्ने २१ चिकित्सकको २० प्रतिशत विरुद्ध ८५.५ प्रतिशत ल्यायो। सहकर्मी-समीक्षा गरिएको संस्करणले छुटेको पक्ष थप्छ: खोज्न र सन्दर्भ हेर्न सक्ने डाक्टरहरूले ३६.१ प्रतिशत ल्याए, जसले अग्रता करिब चार गुणाबाट करिब २.३ गुणामा झार्यो।</p><p><a href="https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-microsoft-ai-diagnostic-tool-doctors-clinical-tests/">TechRepublic</a> का अनुसार अध्ययनले MIMIC-IV-ED डाटाबेसबाट ३२५ आकस्मिक विभाग मामिला पनि परीक्षण गर्यो, जहाँ प्रणालीले चिकित्सकको ४६.८ प्रतिशत विरुद्ध ८०.३ प्रतिशत ल्यायो। <a href="https://tensorfeed.ai/originals/microsoft-mai-dxo-science-doctors-references-gap">TensorFeed</a> ले प्रणालीले पहिलो परीक्षण आदेश गर्नुअघि औसत २५.५ प्रश्न सोधेको, चिकित्सकको ५.६ विरुद्ध, र Microsoft ले बोस्टनको Beth Israel Deaconess Medical Center सँग सम्भावित अध्ययन घोषणा गरेको उल्लेख गर्छ।</p><h2>किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p>निदान AI को सबैभन्दा उच्च जोखिमयुक्त प्रयोगहरूमध्ये एक हो, र सहकर्मी-समीक्षा गरिएको नतिजाले कम्पनी ब्लग पोस्टले नदिने वजन बोक्छ। अध्ययनले अर्केस्ट्रेसनले वास्तविक मूल्य थप्छ भन्ने देखाउँछ: आधारभूत प्रम्प्टसहितको साधारण GPT-5 ले उही मामिलामा ७८.९ प्रतिशत ल्यायो, त्यसैले अर्केस्ट्रेटरले करिब चार अङ्क थप्यो र अनुमानित परीक्षण लागतमा प्रति मामिला करिब ३,००० डलर कटौती गर्यो। यो हप्ताको अन्य स्वास्थ्य AI समाचारसँगको भिन्नताका रूपमा पनि महत्त्वपूर्ण छ, <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/apple-health-ai-usage-study-200000-openevidence-20261117">२ लाख मानिससम्मका लागि Apple स्वास्थ्य AI अध्ययन</a> देखि <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/openai-chatgpt-healthcare-computer-use-agents-20261118">ChatGPT स्वास्थ्य सेवा एजेन्टहरू</a> सम्म, किनकि यो उत्पादन सार्वजनिक होइन, बेन्चमार्क नतिजा हो।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>मामिलाहरू ऐतिहासिक र पाठ-मात्र थिए, शारीरिक जाँच, इमेजिङ वा प्याथोलोजी स्लाइडबिना, र हरेक मामिलामा पुष्टि भएको निदान थियो, त्यसैले अध्ययनले गलत-सकारात्मक दर मापन गर्न सकेन। मानवीय तुलना व्यक्तिगत सामान्य चिकित्सकसँग थियो, विशेषज्ञ वा टोलीसँग होइन, र लेखकहरू भन्छन् विशेषज्ञसँग अन्तर साँघुरो हुने अपेक्षा गर्छन्। लागत आँकडाहरू सिमुलेटेड निदान खर्च हुन्, अस्पताल बचत होइनन्। Microsoft ले Beth Israel अध्ययन कहिले सुरु हुन्छ वा प्रणाली कहिले, यदि कहिल्यै, क्लिनिकल प्रयोगमा पुग्छ भनेको छैन।</p><h2>स्रोतहरू</h2><p><a href="https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-microsoft-ai-diagnostic-tool-doctors-clinical-tests/">TechRepublic</a>; <a href="https://tensorfeed.ai/originals/microsoft-mai-dxo-science-doctors-references-gap">TensorFeed</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-microsoft-ai-diagnostic-tool-doctors-clinical-tests/', 'https://tensorfeed.ai/originals/microsoft-mai-dxo-science-doctors-references-gap'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW()) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- nvidia-ceo-successor-who-replaces-jensen-huang-20261119 (tech-ai; English 523 words; Nepali 494 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'nvidia-ceo-successor-who-replaces-jensen-huang-20261119', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Nvidia CEO Successor: Ian Buck and Colette Kress Lead the Race',
'Nvidia CEO उत्तराधिकारी: Ian Buck र Colette Kress दौडमा अगाडि',
'Nvidia CEO successor race: interim chief Colette Kress and engineer Ian Buck lead the field after Jensen Huang resigned, with Arm chief Rene Haas also named.',
'Nvidia CEO उत्तराधिकारी दौड: Jensen Huang को राजीनामापछि अन्तरिम प्रमुख Colette Kress र इन्जिनियर Ian Buck अगाडि छन्, Arm प्रमुख Rene Haas पनि सम्भावित छन्।',
$$<p>Nvidia CEO successor race: chief financial officer Colette Kress and engineer Ian Buck lead the field to run the world's most valuable chipmaker after Jensen Huang resigned on 12 November 2026. Kress has been named interim chief executive, while Buck is seen as the strongest long-term internal candidate. Huang led Nvidia for 33 years since co-founding it in 1993, so the choice will be the first new chief executive in the company's history.</p><h2>Nvidia CEO successor race at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Information</th></tr><tr><td>Resigned</td><td>Jensen Huang, 12 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Interim CEO</td><td>Colette Kress, chief financial officer since 2013</td></tr><tr><td>Leading internal candidate</td><td>Ian Buck, head of hyperscale AI product, joined 2004</td></tr><tr><td>External candidates</td><td>Rene Haas of Arm, Johny Srouji of Apple</td></tr><tr><td>Other names</td><td>Jeff Fisher, Chris Malachowsky, Andrew Bell</td></tr><tr><td>Board position</td><td>No permanent successor named; outside search firm engaged</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>Huang resigned as chief executive, president and board member on 12 November, after reports of extramarital affairs and an independent investigation announced by the board on 8 November. The board said it had no reason to believe United States national security or company information had been compromised, and the allegations have not been independently established.</p><p>Kress, 59, has been chief financial officer since 2013 after roles at Microsoft, Cisco and Texas Instruments, and she has fronted every earnings call alongside Huang. <a href="https://www.channelnewsasia.com/business/nvidia-jensen-huang-affair-next-ceo-candidates-engineer-cfo-6544986">Channel News Asia</a> reports that some board members favour her for the interim role and that she is the obvious choice to steady the company. Buck, in his late 40s, joined Nvidia in 2004, helped build CUDA, the software platform that keeps developers tied to Nvidia chips, and now heads product for hyperscale AI. Analysts quoted by <a href="https://www.thedailystar.net/news/technology/news/who-could-replace-jensen-huang-nvidia-ceo-4321821">The Daily Star</a> call him the strongest long-term internal candidate. <a href="https://www.forbesindia.com/business/tech/who-is-likely-to-replace-jensen-huang-as-nvidia-ceo-article/3000466">Forbes India</a> confirms Kress was named interim chief executive after Huang stepped down.</p><p>The board met late on 11 November to discuss Huang's future, according to Reuters, and Bloomberg reported it is working with an outside search firm. Prediction market Polymarket favoured Buck as successor, with Kress second, though trading volume on that market is small.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>Nvidia is the dominant supplier of AI processors, and the succession decides who steers its roadmap through the AI build-out. The timing is sharp: the company reports third-quarter results on 17 November, with guidance of 108 billion dollars in revenue, and the call will be the first under interim leadership. Our <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/nvidia-q3-earnings-preview-108-billion-november-17-20261117">Nvidia Q3 earnings preview</a> sets out the numbers that will decide the market reaction. The choice also matters beyond Nvidia, since chip supply shapes the whole AI industry, including the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/us-tightens-china-ai-chip-curbs-samsung-tsmc-20261118">tightened United States chip curbs on China</a> that already limit where its hardware can go.</p><h2>What is not confirmed</h2><p>Nvidia has not named a permanent successor and has not commented on the succession talk. Kress is described in reports as a caretaker rather than a long-term answer, because she has no engineering background, and the board is said to want an engineer in the permanent role. A co-chief executive structure pairing Kress with Buck has been suggested by analysts, but that is speculation, not a board decision. The investigation led by former federal prosecutor Joon Kim continues, and its findings have not been published.</p><h2>Sources</h2><p><a href="https://www.channelnewsasia.com/business/nvidia-jensen-huang-affair-next-ceo-candidates-engineer-cfo-6544986">Channel News Asia</a>; <a href="https://www.thedailystar.net/news/technology/news/who-could-replace-jensen-huang-nvidia-ceo-4321821">The Daily Star</a>; <a href="https://www.forbesindia.com/business/tech/who-is-likely-to-replace-jensen-huang-as-nvidia-ceo-article/3000466">Forbes India</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>Nvidia CEO उत्तराधिकारी दौड: Jensen Huang ले १२ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा राजीनामा दिएपछि विश्वको सबैभन्दा मूल्यवान चिप निर्माता चलाउन मुख्य वित्तीय अधिकृत Colette Kress र इन्जिनियर Ian Buck अगाडि छन्। Kress लाई अन्तरिम प्रमुख कार्यकारी नियुक्त गरिएको छ, भने Buck लाई सबैभन्दा बलियो दीर्घकालीन आन्तरिक उम्मेदवार मानिन्छ। Huang ले सन् १९९३ मा सह-स्थापना गरेदेखि ३३ वर्ष Nvidia को नेतृत्व गरे, त्यसैले यो छनोट कम्पनीको इतिहासमा पहिलो नयाँ प्रमुख कार्यकारी हुनेछ।</p><h2>Nvidia CEO उत्तराधिकारी दौड एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>जानकारी</th></tr><tr><td>राजीनामा</td><td>Jensen Huang, १२ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>अन्तरिम CEO</td><td>Colette Kress, सन् २०१३ देखि मुख्य वित्तीय अधिकृत</td></tr><tr><td>अग्रणी आन्तरिक उम्मेदवार</td><td>Ian Buck, हाइपरस्केल AI उत्पादन प्रमुख, सन् २००४ मा सामेल</td></tr><tr><td>बाह्य उम्मेदवार</td><td>Arm का Rene Haas, Apple का Johny Srouji</td></tr><tr><td>अन्य नाम</td><td>Jeff Fisher, Chris Malachowsky, Andrew Bell</td></tr><tr><td>बोर्डको स्थिति</td><td>स्थायी उत्तराधिकारी घोषणा भएको छैन; बाह्य खोज फर्म संलग्न</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>Huang ले विवाहेतर सम्बन्धका रिपोर्ट र बोर्डले ८ नोभेम्बरमा घोषणा गरेको स्वतन्त्र छानबिनपछि १२ नोभेम्बरमा प्रमुख कार्यकारी, अध्यक्ष र बोर्ड सदस्यबाट राजीनामा दिए। बोर्डले संयुक्त राज्य अमेरिकाको राष्ट्रिय सुरक्षा वा कम्पनीको जानकारीमा सम्झौता भएको विश्वास गर्ने कुनै कारण नभएको बताएको छ, र आरोपहरू स्वतन्त्र रूपमा स्थापित भएका छैनन्।</p><p>५९ वर्षीय Kress Microsoft, Cisco र Texas Instruments मा काम गरेपछि सन् २०१३ देखि मुख्य वित्तीय अधिकृत छन्, र उनले Huang सँगै हरेक आम्दानी कलको नेतृत्व गरेकी छन्। <a href="https://www.channelnewsasia.com/business/nvidia-jensen-huang-affair-next-ceo-candidates-engineer-cfo-6544986">Channel News Asia</a> का अनुसार केही बोर्ड सदस्यहरू उनलाई अन्तरिम भूमिकाका लागि रुचाउँछन् र उनी कम्पनी स्थिर राख्ने स्पष्ट छनोट हुन्। ४० को अन्त्यतिर रहेका Buck सन् २००४ मा Nvidia मा सामेल भए, विकासकर्ताहरूलाई Nvidia चिपसँग बाँध्ने सफ्टवेयर प्लेटफर्म CUDA बनाउन मद्दत गरे, र अहिले हाइपरस्केल AI उत्पादनको नेतृत्व गर्छन्। <a href="https://www.thedailystar.net/news/technology/news/who-could-replace-jensen-huang-nvidia-ceo-4321821">The Daily Star</a> ले उद्धृत गरेका विश्लेषकहरूले उनलाई सबैभन्दा बलियो दीर्घकालीन आन्तरिक उम्मेदवार भन्छन्। <a href="https://www.forbesindia.com/business/tech/who-is-likely-to-replace-jensen-huang-as-nvidia-ceo-article/3000466">Forbes India</a> ले Huang ले पद छोडेपछि Kress लाई अन्तरिम प्रमुख कार्यकारी नियुक्त गरिएको पुष्टि गर्छ।</p><p>Reuters का अनुसार बोर्डले ११ नोभेम्बरको राति Huang को भविष्यबारे छलफल गर्न बैठक गर्यो, र Bloomberg ले बोर्ड बाह्य खोज फर्मसँग काम गरिरहेको बताएको छ। भविष्यवाणी बजार Polymarket ले उत्तराधिकारीका रूपमा Buck लाई अगाडि राख्यो, Kress दोस्रो स्थानमा, यद्यपि त्यो बजारमा कारोबार मात्रा सानो छ।</p><h2>किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p>Nvidia AI प्रोसेसरको प्रमुख आपूर्तिकर्ता हो, र उत्तराधिकारी छनोटले AI विस्तारमा यसको योजना कसले चलाउँछ भन्ने तय गर्छ। समय तीखो छ: कम्पनीले १७ नोभेम्बरमा तेस्रो त्रैमासिक नतिजा सार्वजनिक गर्छ, १०८ अर्ब डलर आम्दानीको मार्गदर्शनसहित, र कल अन्तरिम नेतृत्वमा पहिलो हुनेछ। हाम्रो <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/nvidia-q3-earnings-preview-108-billion-november-17-20261117">Nvidia Q3 आम्दानी पूर्वावलोकन</a> ले बजार प्रतिक्रिया तय गर्ने अङ्कहरू दिन्छ। यो छनोट Nvidia भन्दा बाहिर पनि महत्त्वपूर्ण छ, किनकि चिप आपूर्तिले सम्पूर्ण AI उद्योगलाई आकार दिन्छ, जसमा <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/us-tightens-china-ai-chip-curbs-samsung-tsmc-20261118">चीनमाथि कडा पारिएको संयुक्त राज्य अमेरिकाको चिप प्रतिबन्ध</a> पनि पर्छ, जसले उसको हार्डवेयर कहाँ जान सक्छ भन्ने सीमित गर्छ।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>Nvidia ले स्थायी उत्तराधिकारी घोषणा गरेको छैन र उत्तराधिकार छलफलबारे टिप्पणी गरेको छैन। Kress लाई रिपोर्टहरूमा दीर्घकालीन जवाफ नभई कार्यवाहक भनिएको छ, किनकि उनको इन्जिनियरिङ पृष्ठभूमि छैन, र बोर्ड स्थायी भूमिकामा इन्जिनियर चाहन्छ भनिन्छ। Kress र Buck लाई जोड्ने सह-प्रमुख कार्यकारी संरचना विश्लेषकहरूले सुझाएका छन्, तर त्यो अनुमान हो, बोर्डको निर्णय होइन। पूर्व संघीय अभियोजक Joon Kim को नेतृत्वमा छानबिन जारी छ, र यसका निष्कर्ष प्रकाशित भएका छैनन्।</p><h2>स्रोतहरू</h2><p><a href="https://www.channelnewsasia.com/business/nvidia-jensen-huang-affair-next-ceo-candidates-engineer-cfo-6544986">Channel News Asia</a>; <a href="https://www.thedailystar.net/news/technology/news/who-could-replace-jensen-huang-nvidia-ceo-4321821">The Daily Star</a>; <a href="https://www.forbesindia.com/business/tech/who-is-likely-to-replace-jensen-huang-as-nvidia-ceo-article/3000466">Forbes India</a>।</p>$$,
