-- gta-6-release-date-time-how-to-play-20261119 (tech-ai; English 493 words; Nepali 413 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'gta-6-release-date-time-how-to-play-20261119', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'GTA 6 Release Date and Time: How to Play on Launch Day',
'GTA 6 रिलिज मिति र समय: लन्च दिनमा कसरी खेल्ने',
'GTA 6 release date is Thursday 19 November 2026 on PS5 and Xbox Series X|S, unlocking at midnight local time. Here is how to play on launch day.',
'GTA 6 रिलिज मिति बिहीबार १९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ हो, PS5 र Xbox Series X|S मा स्थानीय समय मध्यरातमा अनलक हुन्छ। लन्च दिनमा कसरी खेल्ने, प्रि-लोड, मूल्य र PC खेलाडीले जान्नुपर्ने कुरा।',
$$<p>Grand Theft Auto VI launches on Thursday 19 November 2026, and the <strong>GTA 6 release date</strong> is locked in after the game went gold. The game unlocks at midnight local time on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S, thirteen years after Grand Theft Auto V.</p><p>Pre-loading has been open since 10 November, so players who bought the game early can download it in advance and start playing the moment their region reaches midnight. The Standard Edition costs 79.99 dollars and the Ultimate Edition costs 99.99 dollars.</p><h2>GTA 6 release date at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Information</th></tr><tr><td>Release date</td><td>19 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td>PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S</td></tr><tr><td>Unlock time</td><td>Midnight local time, rolling by region from New Zealand</td></tr><tr><td>Pre-load</td><td>From 10 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Standard Edition</td><td>79.99 dollars</td></tr><tr><td>Ultimate Edition</td><td>99.99 dollars</td></tr><tr><td>PC version</td><td>No date announced</td></tr><tr><td>Story mode</td><td>Single-player story at launch</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>Rockstar Games confirmed the 19 November date in its official listing, and Take-Two Interactive's lineup published on 9 November lists the game for PS5 and Xbox Series X|S only. Take-Two chief executive Strauss Zelnick said in the company's second quarter fiscal 2027 results that the game has gone gold, which means development is finished and the date is locked. Rockstar's regional guidance says the game unlocks at midnight local time in each region, and <a href="https://windowsforum.com/news/gta-6-release-date-and-preload-ps5-and-xbox-launch-pc-and-online-status.451607/">Windows Forum</a> reports the United States unlock is expected at midnight Eastern Time.</p><p>The launch is the biggest entertainment release of the year. The Miami Heat's Kaseya Center turned into Vice City for a special "Night in Vice City" game on 18 November, the night before release, as reported by <a href="https://www.the-sun.com/sport/17314617/miami-heat-gta-6-vice-city/">The Sun</a>. The game also has a soundtrack album with 34 songs, including new music from Lana Del Rey, Dua Lipa and Zara Larsson, as covered in our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/gta-vi-the-album-lana-del-rey-dua-lipa-zara-larsson-20261118">GTA VI album</a>.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>Take-Two said pre-orders are already at unprecedented levels, according to <a href="https://pixelherald.com/is-gta-6-on-pc-release-date-and-what-rockstar-has-said/">Pixel Herald</a>, and other games moved their release dates away from 19 November to avoid the launch, as <a href="https://indietooling.com/posts/gta-6-launch-window">Indie Tooling</a> reported. The first reviews and player numbers on launch day will show whether the game meets expectations built over thirteen years.</p><p>The launch also shows how big entertainment moments now stack up in the same season: the Coachella 2027 lineup, covered in our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/coachella-2027-lineup-dua-lipa-sza-tame-impala-20261118">Coachella 2027</a>, was announced a week earlier, and GTA VI is the largest launch of them all.</p><h2>What is not confirmed</h2><p>Rockstar has not announced a PC release date. A GamesBeat report, citing four unnamed industry sources, says a PC version is planned for the first quarter of 2027, but Rockstar has not confirmed it. The "New Zealand trick" of changing a console's region to play early is not confirmed to work for GTA VI, and Rockstar's own guidance does not promise it. Whether the game runs at 30 frames per second on all consoles is reported but not confirmed by Rockstar, and launch day server performance and review scores are not known yet.</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>TradingView, 10 November 2026: https://www.tradingview.com/news/moodys:90e38a1a123fe:0-gta-6-release-date-confirmed-for-november-19-pre-load-new-zealand-early-access-pc-update-and-1-million-car/</p><p>Windows Forum, 15 November 2026: https://windowsforum.com/news/gta-6-release-date-and-preload-ps5-and-xbox-launch-pc-and-online-status.451607/</p><p>Pixel Herald: https://pixelherald.com/is-gta-6-on-pc-release-date-and-what-rockstar-has-said/</p><p>Indie Tooling, 16 November 2026: https://indietooling.com/posts/gta-6-launch-window</p><p>The Sun, 17 November 2026: https://www.the-sun.com/sport/17314617/miami-heat-gta-6-vice-city/</p>$$,
$$<p>Grand Theft Auto VI बिहीबार १९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा रिलिज हुँदैछ, र <strong>GTA 6 रिलिज मिति</strong> खेल गोल्ड भएपछि पक्का भएको छ। यो खेल PlayStation 5 र Xbox Series X|S मा स्थानीय समय मध्यरातमा अनलक हुन्छ, Grand Theft Auto V आएको तेह्र वर्षपछि।</p><p>प्रि-लोड १० नोभेम्बरदेखि खुला छ, त्यसैले खेल किनेका खेलाडीले अग्रिम डाउनलोड गरेर आफ्नो क्षेत्रमा मध्यरात हुनेबित्तिकै खेल्न सक्छन्। Standard Edition को मूल्य ७९.९९ डलर र Ultimate Edition को ९९.९९ डलर छ।</p><h2>GTA 6 रिलिज मिति एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>जानकारी</th></tr><tr><td>रिलिज मिति</td><td>१९ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>प्लेटफर्म</td><td>PlayStation 5 र Xbox Series X|S</td></tr><tr><td>अनलक समय</td><td>स्थानीय समय मध्यरात, न्युजिल्यान्डबाट सुरु भएर क्षेत्रअनुसार क्रमशः</td></tr><tr><td>प्रि-लोड</td><td>१० नोभेम्बर २०२६ देखि</td></tr><tr><td>Standard Edition</td><td>७९.९९ डलर</td></tr><tr><td>Ultimate Edition</td><td>९९.९९ डलर</td></tr><tr><td>PC संस्करण</td><td>मिति घोषणा भएको छैन</td></tr><tr><td>स्टोरी मोड</td><td>लन्चमा एकल खेलाडी स्टोरी</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>Rockstar Games ले १९ नोभेम्बरको मिति आफ्नो आधिकारिक सूचीमा पुष्टि गर्यो, र Take-Two Interactive ले ९ नोभेम्बरमा प्रकाशित आफ्नो सूचीमा खेल PS5 र Xbox Series X|S का लागि मात्र राख्यो। Take-Two का प्रमुख कार्यकारी स्ट्रस जेलनिकले कम्पनीको दोस्रो त्रैमासिक वित्तीय २०२७ नतिजामा खेल गोल्ड भइसकेको बताए, जसको अर्थ विकास सकिएको छ र मिति पक्का छ। Rockstar को क्षेत्रीय मार्गदर्शन अनुसार खेल प्रत्येक क्षेत्रमा स्थानीय समय मध्यरातमा अनलक हुन्छ, र अमेरिकामा मध्यरात पूर्वीय समयमा अनलक हुने अपेक्षा छ।</p><p>यो वर्षको सबैभन्दा ठूलो मनोरञ्जन लन्च हो। मियामी हिटको केस्या सेन्टर रिलिजको अघिल्लो रात, १८ नोभेम्बरमा विशेष "Night in Vice City" खेलका लागि Vice City मा परिणत भयो। खेलसँगै ३४ गीत भएको साउन्डट्र्याक एल्बम पनि आउँदैछ, जसमा Lana Del Rey, Dua Lipa र Zara Larsson को नयाँ संगीत छ।</p><h2>किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p>Take-Two ले प्रि-अर्डर अभूतपूर्व स्तरमा रहेको बतायो, र अन्य खेलले १९ नोभेम्बरको लन्चबाट जोगिन आफ्नो रिलिज मिति सारे। लन्च दिनको पहिलो समीक्षा र खेलाडी सङ्ख्याले तेह्र वर्षको अपेक्षा पूरा हुन्छ कि हुँदैन भन्ने देखाउनेछ।</p><p>यो लन्चले ठूला मनोरञ्जन क्षण अहिले एउटै सिजनमा कसरी थुप्रिन्छन् भन्ने पनि देखाउँछ: Coachella २०२७ लाइनअप एक हप्ता अघि घोषणा भएको थियो, र GTA VI ती सबैमध्ये सबैभन्दा ठूलो लन्च हो।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>Rockstar ले PC रिलिज मिति घोषणा गरेको छैन। GamesBeat को रिपोर्टले चार अज्ञात उद्योग स्रोत उद्धृत गर्दै PC संस्करण २०२७ को पहिलो त्रैमासिकमा आउने योजना रहेको बताउँछ, तर Rockstar ले यसको पुष्टि गरेको छैन। क्षेत्र परिवर्तन गरेर चाँडो खेल्ने "New Zealand trick" ले GTA VI मा काम गर्छ भन्ने पुष्टि भएको छैन, र Rockstar को आफ्नै मार्गदर्शनले यसको वाचा गर्दैन। सबै कन्सोलमा खेल ३० फ्रेम प्रति सेकेन्डमा चल्छ कि चल्दैन भन्ने रिपोर्ट गरिएको छ तर Rockstar ले पुष्टि गरेको छैन, र लन्च दिनको सर्भर प्रदर्शन र समीक्षा स्कोर अझै थाहा छैन।</p><h2>स्रोतहरू</h2><p>TradingView, १० नोभेम्बर २०२६: https://www.tradingview.com/news/moodys:90e38a1a123fe:0-gta-6-release-date-confirmed-for-november-19-pre-load-new-zealand-early-access-pc-update-and-1-million-car/</p><p>Windows Forum, १५ नोभेम्बर २०२६: https://windowsforum.com/news/gta-6-release-date-and-preload-ps5-and-xbox-launch-pc-and-online-status.451607/</p><p>Pixel Herald: https://pixelherald.com/is-gta-6-on-pc-release-date-and-what-rockstar-has-said/</p><p>Indie Tooling, १६ नोभेम्बर २०२६: https://indietooling.com/posts/gta-6-launch-window</p><p>The Sun, १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६: https://www.the-sun.com/sport/17314617/miami-heat-gta-6-vice-city/</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.tradingview.com/news/moodys:90e38a1a123fe:0-gta-6-release-date-confirmed-for-november-19-pre-load-new-zealand-early-access-pc-update-and-1-million-car/', 'https://windowsforum.com/news/gta-6-release-date-and-preload-ps5-and-xbox-launch-pc-and-online-status.451607/', 'https://pixelherald.com/is-gta-6-on-pc-release-date-and-what-rockstar-has-said/', 'https://indietooling.com/posts/gta-6-launch-window', 'https://www.the-sun.com/sport/17314617/miami-heat-gta-6-vice-city/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW()) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- anthropic-ipo-debut-ant-first-trade-20261119 (tech-ai; English 495 words; Nepali 374 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'anthropic-ipo-debut-ant-first-trade-20261119', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Anthropic IPO Debut: What to Watch as ANT Starts Trading',
'Anthropic IPO सुरुवात: ANT कारोबार सुरु हुँदा के हेर्ने',
'Anthropic IPO debut is set for Thursday 19 November, when ANT starts trading on Nasdaq after pricing on 18 November. Here is what to watch on day one.',
'Anthropic IPO सुरुवात बिहीबार १९ नोभेम्बरमा तय छ, जब १८ नोभेम्बरमा मूल्य निर्धारणपछि ANT ले Nasdaq मा कारोबार सुरु गर्छ। पहिलो दिन के हेर्ने।',
$$<p>Anthropic, the company behind the Claude AI models, is set for its stock market debut on Thursday 19 November 2026, and the <strong>Anthropic IPO debut</strong> will be the most watched first trade of the year. Shares are expected to start trading on the Nasdaq as <strong>ANT</strong> after pricing on Wednesday evening.</p><p>The company is offering 825 million shares at 70 to 78 dollars per share, which would raise up to 64.4 billion dollars and value Anthropic at up to about 1.4 trillion dollars fully diluted. Orders for the shares were reported to be close to seven times the amount on offer, according to <a href="https://memeburn.com/anthropics-ipo-is-7x-oversubscribed-but-its-record-depends-on-26-billion/">Memeburn</a>, citing Bloomberg.</p><h2>Anthropic IPO debut at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Information</th></tr><tr><td>Pricing</td><td>Wednesday 18 November 2026, evening</td></tr><tr><td>First trade</td><td>Thursday 19 November 2026, Nasdaq, ticker ANT</td></tr><tr><td>Price range</td><td>70 to 78 dollars per share</td></tr><tr><td>Shares offered</td><td>825 million Class A shares</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum raise</td><td>About 64.4 billion dollars</td></tr><tr><td>Fully diluted valuation</td><td>Up to about 1.4 trillion dollars</td></tr><tr><td>Demand</td><td>About seven times oversubscribed</td></tr><tr><td>Strategic buyers</td><td>26 billion dollars from AMD, Broadcom, Google, Micron, Microsoft, Nvidia and TSMC</td></tr><tr><td>Retail allocation</td><td>Up to 20 percent of shares offered</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>Anthropic filed its S-1 prospectus on 26 October 2026 and set the price range in an amended filing on 10 November, as covered in our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/anthropic-ipo-pricing-november-18-nasdaq-debut-20261118">Anthropic IPO pricing</a>. The filing shows revenue of 33.2 billion dollars for the nine months ended 30 September 2026, and a revenue run rate of 81 billion dollars as of 31 October.</p><p>Seven of Anthropic's suppliers, including Google and Nvidia, agreed to buy 26 billion dollars of non voting stock at the IPO price, and up to 20 percent of the shares are reserved for retail investors through brokers including Charles Schwab, Fidelity, Robinhood, SoFi and E*TRADE, as reported by <a href="https://memeburn.com/anthropics-ipo-is-7x-oversubscribed-but-its-record-depends-on-26-billion/">Memeburn</a>. The final price is set on Wednesday evening, and trading starts on Thursday, according to <a href="https://ainewsround.com/blog/anthropic-ipo-prices-wednesday-and-trades-thursday-as-ant-what-retail-investors-should-know">AI News Round</a>.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>This is the first standalone frontier AI lab to list on a US exchange, and the debut is being treated as a verdict on the AI boom. A strong first day would support the case that public markets will pay up for AI growth; a weak one would raise questions after a sharp tech selloff.</p><p>Retail investors can buy from Thursday, but only through brokers that offer US stocks, and the opening price may sit well above the IPO price. New listings can swing sharply in their first days, so the first trade and the closing price are the two numbers to watch. Anthropic's AI models are also moving into workplaces: the company launched self hosted Claude Managed Agents, covered in our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/anthropic-claude-managed-agents-self-hosted-beta-20261117">Claude Managed Agents</a>.</p><h2>What is not confirmed</h2><p>The final price is not set until Wednesday evening, and it could land inside the range, above it or below it. The first trade price and the closing price on day one are not known. The order book was reported to be about seven times oversubscribed, but the final allocation is not confirmed. Trading remains subject to regulatory clearance.</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>AI News Round, 17 November 2026: https://ainewsround.com/blog/anthropic-ipo-prices-wednesday-and-trades-thursday-as-ant-what-retail-investors-should-know</p><p>Memeburn, 17 November 2026: https://memeburn.com/anthropics-ipo-is-7x-oversubscribed-but-its-record-depends-on-26-billion/</p><p>Minrk: https://www.minrk.com/article/anthropic-ipo-date-set-for-nov-18-pricing</p>$$,
$$<p>Claude AI मोडेल पछाडिको कम्पनी Anthropic बिहीबार १९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा सेयर बजारमा सुरुवात गर्न तयार छ, र <strong>Anthropic IPO सुरुवात</strong> वर्षको सबैभन्दा धेरै हेरिने पहिलो कारोबार हुनेछ। बुधबार साँझ मूल्य निर्धारणपछि सेयर Nasdaq मा <strong>ANT</strong> का रूपमा कारोबार सुरु गर्ने अपेक्षा छ।</p><p>कम्पनीले ८२५ मिलियन सेयर प्रति सेयर ७० देखि ७८ डलरमा प्रस्ताव गरिरहेको छ, जसले ६४.४ अर्ब डलरसम्म उठाउनेछ र Anthropic को मूल्य पूर्ण रूपमा पातलो आधारमा करिब १.४ ट्रिलियन डलरसम्म हुनेछ। सेयरका लागि अर्डर प्रस्तावित मात्राभन्दा करिब सात गुणा बढी भएको रिपोर्ट छ।</p><h2>Anthropic IPO सुरुवात एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>जानकारी</th></tr><tr><td>मूल्य निर्धारण</td><td>बुधबार १८ नोभेम्बर २०२६, साँझ</td></tr><tr><td>पहिलो कारोबार</td><td>बिहीबार १९ नोभेम्बर २०२६, Nasdaq, टिकर ANT</td></tr><tr><td>मूल्य दायरा</td><td>प्रति सेयर ७० देखि ७८ डलर</td></tr><tr><td>प्रस्तावित सेयर</td><td>८२५ मिलियन क्लास A सेयर</td></tr><tr><td>अधिकतम उठाउने रकम</td><td>करिब ६४.४ अर्ब डलर</td></tr><tr><td>पूर्ण रूपमा पातलो मूल्याङ्कन</td><td>करिब १.४ ट्रिलियन डलरसम्म</td></tr><tr><td>माग</td><td>करिब सात गुणा बढी भरिएको</td></tr><tr><td>रणनीतिक खरिदकर्ता</td><td>AMD, Broadcom, Google, Micron, Microsoft, Nvidia र TSMC बाट २६ अर्ब डलर</td></tr><tr><td>खुद्रा बाँडफाँट</td><td>प्रस्तावित सेयरको २० प्रतिशतसम्म</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>Anthropic ले २६ अक्टोबर २०२६ मा S-1 विवरणपत्र दायर गर्यो र १० नोभेम्बरमा संशोधित दायरामा मूल्य दायरा तय गर्यो। दायराले ३० सेप्टेम्बर २०२६ मा समाप्त नौ महिनामा ३३.२ अर्ब डलर राजस्व र ३१ अक्टोबरसम्म ८१ अर्ब डलर राजस्व रन रेट देखाउँछ।</p><p>Anthropic का सात आपूर्तिकर्ता, जसमा Google र Nvidia समावेश छन्, ले IPO मूल्यमा २६ अर्ब डलरको गैर मतदान सेयर किन्न सहमति गरे, र सेयरको २० प्रतिशतसम्म खुद्रा लगानीकर्ताका लागि Charles Schwab, Fidelity, Robinhood, SoFi र E*TRADE लगायत ब्रोकरमार्फत छुट्याइएको छ। अन्तिम मूल्य बुधबार साँझ तय हुन्छ, र कारोबार बिहीबार सुरु हुन्छ।</p><h2>किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p>यो अमेरिकी एक्सचेन्जमा सूचीकृत हुने पहिलो एकल फ्रन्टियर AI प्रयोगशाला हो, र यो सुरुवातलाई AI उछालमाथिको फैसलाका रूपमा हेरिँदैछ। बलियो पहिलो दिनले सार्वजनिक बजारले AI वृद्धिका लागि मूल्य तिर्नेछ भन्ने तर्कलाई बल दिनेछ; कमजोर दिनले प्रविधि बिक्रीपछि कठिन प्रश्न उठाउनेछ।</p><p>खुद्रा लगानीकर्ताले बिहीबारदेखि किन्न सक्छन्, तर अमेरिकी सेयर प्रस्ताव गर्ने ब्रोकरमार्फत मात्र, र सुरुवाती मूल्य IPO मूल्यभन्दा धेरै माथि हुन सक्छ। नयाँ सूचीकरण पहिलो दिनहरूमा तीव्र रूपमा घटबढ हुन सक्छ, त्यसैले पहिलो कारोबार र बन्द मूल्य हेर्नुपर्ने दुई सङ्ख्या हुन्।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>अन्तिम मूल्य बुधबार साँझसम्म तय हुँदैन, र यो दायराभित्र, माथि वा तल कतै पनि पर्न सक्छ। पहिलो दिनको पहिलो कारोबार मूल्य र बन्द मूल्य थाहा छैन। अर्डर बुक करिब सात गुणा बढी भरिएको रिपोर्ट गरिएको थियो, तर अन्तिम बाँडफाँट पुष्टि भएको छैन। कारोबार नियामक स्वीकृतिको अधीनमा रहन्छ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरू</h2><p>AI News Round, १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६: https://ainewsround.com/blog/anthropic-ipo-prices-wednesday-and-trades-thursday-as-ant-what-retail-investors-should-know</p><p>Memeburn, १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६: https://memeburn.com/anthropics-ipo-is-7x-oversubscribed-but-its-record-depends-on-26-billion/</p><p>Minrk: https://www.minrk.com/article/anthropic-ipo-date-set-for-nov-18-pricing</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://ainewsround.com/blog/anthropic-ipo-prices-wednesday-and-trades-thursday-as-ant-what-retail-investors-should-know', 'https://memeburn.com/anthropics-ipo-is-7x-oversubscribed-but-its-record-depends-on-26-billion/', 'https://www.minrk.com/article/anthropic-ipo-date-set-for-nov-18-pricing'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW()) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

